      "created_at": "2016-10-29T20:50:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I'm making my own deck that has a function similar to what Completionist Guise does (Swap out Character Cards) and the question arises; what happens to the HP of a character card swapped out if their current HP is higher than the new Variant's Max HP? Does it just automatically go down to the Max HP or do they stay above Max HP until brought down and simply cant' recover more than their current Max HP?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyone up for this?</p>",
