      "created_at": "2016-10-30T01:34:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Health cannot be above maximum.</p><p>So if the new maximum is lower than current health, health would reset to the new maximum.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I use the unofficial term reset because you aren't losing health, your health is just changed.</p>",
